<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange ended sharply higher in active trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 173.38 to 6833.59.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 6.44 to 405.84.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.64.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1533 to 955.</p>
<p>Volume was 501,976,130 compared with 393,653,080 on Monday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EST/2045 GMT).</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
